  {
    "section": "teaching-philosophy",
    "field": "Paragraph 1",
    "value": "In an age where information is abundant and AI can generate answers in seconds, I believe the greatest competitive advantage isn't knowing more. It's developing the judgment to ask better questions, recognize opportunities and make thoughtful decisions.",
    "link": "",
    "notes": ""
  },
  {
    "section": "teaching-philosophy",
    "field": "Paragraph 2",
    "value": "Whether I'm teaching university students, facilitating executive workshops or speaking at conferences, my goal is to connect theory with practice through discussion, current events and real-world business cases.",
